# Files that may hold a glyph in a string, one "path: reason" per line.
ui/runs.go: the status table of runs, drawn with the icon set's own fallbacks
ui/glyphs.go: the glyph tables of the icon sets
ui/theme.go: the Unicode dot and ring of the default status table
ui/drawing.go: the Unicode icon set and the fallbacks for zero icons
ui/uitest/problems.go: test fixtures for error texts
pulls/panes_desc.go: tells the ASCII set from the others by its ellipsis
prpanes/conv/glyphs.go: the Unicode glyphs of the conversation pane's factory
prpanes/desc/rows.go: the ASCII ellipsis that marks the description's cut rows
prpanes/diffview/title.go: the Unicode glyphs that tests use
prpanes/files/glyphs.go: the glyphs of the files pane's factory
